"Ella-Clara is a B-rank CNH hero student with chin-length brown hair, viciously competitive."
"She is a Figurinist, the only known B-rank of that ultra-rare class."
"She mind-controls a single figurine, hers the same size as she is."
"She tops the B-List's Beat List by beating second-year A's, a spot Francis and BeeBee gave her."
"In the flood she was among the rogue B's who went to Sānjiǎo Beach; SkySea Guard hunted them."
"Her surname is Thomas; she gained only four levels this year, which she calls too slow."
